[40.203,"o","1) grr transport (plain-text report; no JSON flag): probes Gmail base, negotiates HTTP/3 when available, reports runtime\r\n"]
[40.419,"o","features (cpus, io_uring) and fallback; here it fails because no OAuth client is configured locally.\r\n"]
[40.679,"o","\r\n"]
[40.859,"o","2) grr ask \"show my unread messages\" --dry-run (JSON): resolves to gmail.users.messages.list (GET\r\n"]
[41.057,"o","https://gmail.googleapis.com/gmail/v1/users/me/messages) with userId \"me\", plan-only (dryRun true), confidence ~0.9,\r\n"]
[41.269,"o","serviceConfidence ~0.99, scopes include gmail.readonly.\r\n"]
[41.493,"o","\r\n"]
[41.673,"o","3) grr gmail users messages list --user-id me --dry-run (JSON): prints the exact request the API would receive as a dry-run\r\n"]
[41.892,"o","plan (method, URL, params, HTTP verb) without executing.\r\n"]
[43.517,"o","\u001b[2m# grr 0.8.0 — 9 segments recorded by scripts/generate-demo.ts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
